      "text": "LFM3 is Liquid AI's latest family of efficient foundation models built on a proprietary \"tri-hybrid architecture\" that blends liquid neural network dynamics with attention and other components to achieve high performance at very small parameter counts. The family includes text (LFM3-1.7B) and vision-language (LFM3-VL-2B) variants, both offering 256K-token context windows, 4-bit quantization footprints around 1 GB for on-device deployment, and post-training for agentic workflows. The VL model adds an in-house vision encoder, video understanding, and explicit step-by-step reasoning. LFM3 matters because it pushes frontier capabilities — long context, multimodal reasoning, agentic behavior — into the mobile and edge compute envelope, enabling local-first AI applications without cloud dependency."
